    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PROFOUND is bound to be the most profound game you will ever play. With a name like PROFOUND how can it NOT? PROFOUND is a action RPG game made by only one person using good ole fashioned unity. The game is set to deliver a fun and unique style of combat to RPG games by taking inspiration from old and new RPG's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Explore anywhere, a linear-like open world game world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. General silliness, start nude, anime girls are an enemy type</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Full inventory &amp; equipment system </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Levels, skills, special abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Gold, silver, &amp; copper money system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Professions like wood cutting, brewing, fishing &amp; cooking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Muli-Save system that saves multiple save files locally <br><br>8. Quests &amp; quest log system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9. Navigation system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10. Horse mounts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
